(text "ZERO-CROSS INPUT" (at 284.48 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8ddb4730-5504-4541-945b-0b88e2416be4))
(text "TRIAC FIRING" (at 170.18 128.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bb485e9b-a6d7-4936-8f18-c47f7f39b19c))
(text "5 V BULK" (at 332.74 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 57fc1aef-058f-4c9c-8a05-73665c9c5f78))
(text "MOTOR CURRENT (optional)" (at 132.08 120.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c81eae17-0bc5-465f-bc35-c84431329a77))
(text "RP2350B CORE BOARD (pins by GPIO number)" (at 124.46 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bd54e310-0342-4f53-94ad-fa69126d6b82))
(text "HAND-WHEEL INDEX SENSOR (one magnet, one pulse per stitch)" (at 200.66 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid db59a2a8-d5c3-485d-9d57-98c5961013e6))
(text "HAND-WHEEL ENCODER (two Hall latches, quadrature; same cable as the index)" (at 297.18 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 86be1028-223a-4c4d-b605-52db5514457a))
(text "HEEL SWITCH" (at 55.88 199.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cf54d2ef-ee75-42ac-9604-cbc6f5151a29))
(text "SWITCHES (internal pull-ups)" (at 170.18 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0ce2aa4a-7e10-4dca-a4d8-1170930a8673))
(text "OPERATOR INPUTS (RC-filtered ADC)" (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3a92ca9b-5c80-4dcd-b51e-03f7cfc66e5f))
(text "RESEARCH ONLY: NOT SAFE TO BUILD AS DRAWN. Not built, tested, measured or safety-assessed; a barrier drawn here is not proof of isolation." (at 20.32 258.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b9ffa869-eb13-4bb9-9c85-219e91e44ac6))
(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 261.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9893f902-689a-4e29-bec1-11616b47f768))
(text "1. After Freescale AN1662: zero-cross interrupt sets a timer alarm (or a PIO program); at the firing delay a ~100 us gate pulse fires the" (at 20.32 263.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8c7c91d6-ba00-4de2-9201-4691617167d2))
(text "   triac; hand-wheel period from edge timestamps; speed loop every half-cycle (120 Hz); stall watchdog. Added: isolation, relay, inputs." (at 20.32 265.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 32475bb6-e05d-475a-ad29-961b2ac0aefa))
(text "2. Pins (RP2350B): FIRE GP4; RELAY GP5; ZC GP6; HALL (index) GP7; ENC_A/B GP2/GP3 (PIO counter); STITCH GP10; HEEL GP11; NEEDLE GP12;" (at 20.32 268.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 70159f8a-2e17-44b4-a675-2061c2bb3b96))
(text "   knee, pedal, FSR, limit on ADC0-3 (GP40-43); ISENSE ADC4; ADC5-7 spare; GP8/GP9 UART1 for debug (or USB serial). Avoid GP0, GP23, GP25 (PSRAM, key, LED)." (at 20.32 270.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1981cf28-7f37-46b2-bc42-55e5b0d4e233))
(text "3. PS1 feeds VSYS through D2, so USB and PS1 may both be connected. Until a built board's isolation is checked, unplug the mains before USB or SWD. Drive GP4 at 8-12 mA." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3fe58f3c-95dd-4cd9-a189-364f398d7952))
(text "4. Fire only after a zero-cross has been seen and the command is zero; close K1 last and open it first; if zero-crosses stop, stop firing and open K1. Never scope the line side." (at 20.32 275.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5efd9213-c8fc-4dd8-adab-2bb5f4ec7b36))
(text "5. R7/R8: ~3.9 mA peak in the H11AA1; R11: ~8 mA into U3 from 3.3 V; R6/C2 fitted only if a snubberless triac false-fires. T1 optional: motor lead through its window, 0.1 V/A about 1.65 V." (at 20.32 277.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ef0fe5b9-06c8-43cc-996f-ca1ca97bffaa))
(text "6. On a WeAct RP2350B Core board, feed PS1 to the 5V pin: the board has its own diode from USB VBUS, so D2 may be left out." (at 20.32 280.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d968501b-da87-44da-ab36-a87acedc9c82))
(text "7. Heel: momentary switch to GND in either pedal (J5 pin 4, J6 pin 3); a heel tap sends the needle to its other stop." (at 20.32 282.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fcce57ba-a896-4520-bf79-6832b9c3f89f))
(text "8. Encoder U5/U6 (ring of alternating magnets) optional: stops taught and landed by angle; 5-wire cable (3V3, GND, index, A, B)." (at 20.32 285.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8e95b635-31cb-4935-afab-44711f7f9f61))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
